# Runtime scratch. Reports, plans and results are per-machine working files that
# Unity writes into the test project, never source.
sidequest-lighting/**/SideQuestLighting/

# Generated fixtures. TestSceneBuilder is the source of truth for these - a .unity
# file is an opaque diff, and committing both the generator and its output invites
# them to disagree. Rebuild with Tools > SideQuest > Lighting > Tests > Build All.
sidequest-lighting/Tests/Scenes/
sidequest-lighting/Tests/Materials/
sidequest-lighting/Tests/Scenes.meta
sidequest-lighting/Tests/Materials.meta
